    invariant_4_test.go:338: Edge cases and error scenarios:
    invariant_4_test.go:339: 
    invariant_4_test.go:340: 1. Empty database:
    invariant_4_test.go:341:    - All queries return 0 rows (correct)
    invariant_4_test.go:342:    - No false positives
    invariant_4_test.go:343: 
