    invariant_4_test.go:350:    - Queries run in READ COMMITTED isolation
    invariant_4_test.go:351:    - May see inconsistent snapshot (acceptable for audit)
    invariant_4_test.go:352:    - For exact consistency, use REPEATABLE READ transaction
